answer:
Add this stdio server entry to your agent’s MCP configuration, using an absolute executable path if `colony` is not on PATH and an absolute home path:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "colony": {
      "command": "colony",
      "args": ["--home", "/absolute/path/to/agent-home", "mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

